      "id": "scene008-02",
      "scene": "scene008",
      "text": "「そうだよ。」",
      "speaker": "ダンゴ"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene008-03",
      "scene": "scene008",
      "text": "「……暗いですね。」",
      "speaker": "主人公"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene008-04",
      "scene": "scene008",
      "text": "「地下だからな。」",
      "speaker": "ダンゴ"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene008-05",
      "scene": "scene008",
      "text": "「倉庫はこの先だ。はぐれるなよ。」",
      "speaker": "ダンゴ"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene008-06",
      "scene": "scene008",
      "text": "「待って、ダンゴさん！」",
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "forceTransition": true,
      "nextSceneId": "scene009-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene009-01",
      "scene": "scene009",
      "text": "「……まだ着かないんですか？」",
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "background": "../assets/bg/underground_corridor.png?v=20260704",
